    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The proposed development due to its excessive scale and bulk and poor and unsympathetic design would give rise to an unduly obtrusive and incongruous extension which would fail to respect the scale of the subject dwelling and would not preserve and enhance the character and appearance of the locally listed building, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the host building, locality and the visual amenities of the neighbouring occupiers, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 D.1, D.11,D.12 and D.7 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 B and D of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012, policies DM 1 and DM 7 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
